t into the wild  today so  uh so yeah we'd love to hear more from  you and please  feel free to email or call our us  anytime and talk more  so thanks thanks alexis appreciate the  hosting and thanks everybody for joining  thank you again steve for your time  today and for your important research  we would also like to thank lavertz and  our sponsor horizon discovery for  underwriting today's educational webcast  before we go i'd like to thank the  audience again for joining us  and for their interesting questions as a  reminder questions that we did not have  time for today  and those submitted during the on-demand  period will be addressed by our speaker  via the contact information that you  provided  at the time of registration so please  feel free to keep those questions coming  in  this webcast can be viewed on demand  laborats will alert you via email when  it's available for replay  we encourage you to share that email  with your colleagues who may have missed  today's live event  that's all for now stay stay healthy  stay safe  thank you everyone bye

